  (text "ZUUP COMPUTER | STAGE 1: TRANSISTOR NOR GATE" (at 18 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3f4ba8d3-b62a-4973-abf4-70a3198ef245")) (text "5 V only. A and B are logic inputs (0 V or +5 V). Y = NOT (A OR B)." (at 18 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b69a9ef4-9c27-4464-ac31-7b61c37bfff2")) (text "J1: +5V, GND, A, B     J2: Y, GND" (at 18 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "482773ea-8af4-4071-81cd-36c304195049")) (text "Both transistor emitters go to GND. Shared collectors form Y; R1 pulls Y high." (at 18 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "98496059-295b-4aab-8706-c8f531f4f853")) (text "R2/R3 limit base current. R4/R5 hold each base low when an input is open." (at 18 134 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cfef3c60-a9a2-4a6f-b43c-6ef1c0c165c7")) (text "2N3904 pin order used: 1=E, 2=B, 3=C. Verify the exact part datasheet before assembly." (at 18 138 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b335403f-437d-4772-8abf-d8d95bdb6f76"))
